  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 162 ÷ 3 + 5 × 6 - 2 = 274 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and - \n\n162 ÷ 3 + 5 × 6 - 2 = 274 ⇒ **162 ÷ 3**__ - 5 × 6 + 2 = 274\n\n54 - __**5 × 6**__ + 2 = 274\n\n__**54 + 2**__ - 30 = 274\n\n__**56 - 30**__ = 274\n\n26 ≠ 274 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷ and × \n\n162 ÷ 3 + 5 × 6 - 2 = 274 ⇒ 162 × 3 + **5 ÷ 6**__ - 2 = 274\n\n__**162 ×**____** 3**__ + 0.83 - 2 = 274\n\n__**486 **____**+ 0.83**__ - 2 = 274\n\n__**486.83 - 2**__ = 274\n\n484.83 ≠ 274 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : - and ÷ \n\n162 ÷ 3 + 5 × 6 - 2 = 274 ⇒ 162 - 3 + 5 × **6 ÷ 2**__ = 274\n\n162 - 3 + __**5 × 3**__ = 274\n\n__**162 + 15**__ - 3 = 274\n\n__**177 - 3**__ = 274\n\n174 ≠ 274 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and × \n\n162 ÷ 3 + 5 × 6 - 2 = 274 ⇒ **162 ÷ 3**__ × 5 + 6 - 2 = 274\n\n__**54 ×**____** 5**__ + 6 - 2 = 274\n\n__**270 + 6**__ - 2 = 274\n\n__**276 - 2**__ = 274\n\n**274 = 274 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
